T1  - Clinical safety and tolerability evaluation of Withania somnifera (L.) Dunal (Ashwagandha) root extract in healthy human volunteers
AU  - Vaidya, Vidyadhar G.
AU  - Gothwad, Amol
AU  - Ganu, Gayatri
