T1  - Dynamic trajectory analysis to identify conditioned pain modulation profiles in pain-free volunteers: Capturing what is lost when focusing on mean effects
AU  - Vincenot, Matthieu
AU  - Roberge, Maxime
AU  - Giguère, Charles-Édouard
AU  - Potvin, Stéphane
JO  - The Journal of Pain
VL  - 44
