T1  - Understanding Barriers and Facilitators to Signing Up for a Mobile-Responsive Registry to Recruit Healthy Volunteers and Members of Underrepresented Communities for Alzheimer's Disease Prevention Studies
AU  - Neffa-Creech, D.
AU  - Aggarwal, R.
