T1  - Family involvement in the Namaste care family program for dementia: A qualitative study on experiences of family, nursing home staff, and volunteers
AU  - Tasseron-Dries, Petra E.M.
AU  - Smaling, Hanneke J.A.
AU  - Doncker, Sarah M.M.M.
AU  - Achterberg, Wilco P.
AU  - van der Steen, Jenny T.
